{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Jump on clouds",
    "steam_appid": 2907080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/1fc3ea1f2f459917c2a21a53e999f271.avif?t=1722237410\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/cee69ca6454b8cc33dc4778c3fc0de0c.poster.avif?t=1722237410\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/cee69ca6454b8cc33dc4778c3fc0de0c.webm?t=1722237410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/cee69ca6454b8cc33dc4778c3fc0de0c.mp4?t=1722237410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Jump on Clouds&quot; is a whimsical adventure that invites players to leap through a vibrant sky filled with fluffy clouds and unexpected surprises. In this delightful game, you'll navigate through 30 levels of cloud-hopping fun. There is also infitity mode.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/8cbd9288ab7bf51d62138fcbd88cdf64.avif?t=1722237410\" width=500 height=125 /></span><br>As you bound from cloud to cloud, you'll encounter a variety of entertaining events that add spice to your journey. Keep an eye out for mischievous cats, adorable anime girls, and even the occasional appearance of everyone's favorite green ogre, Shr\u0435g! These unexpected encounters not only keep you on your toes but also add a dash of humor and excitement to your cloud-hopping escapades.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/b5c59a253ad78c8553e3de4d098e39ea.avif?t=1722237410\" width=500 height=125 /></span><br>But it's not just the quirky events that make &quot;Jump on Clouds&quot; a delight to play. The game also features dynamic weather systems in infinity mode that affect your gameplay. From sunny skies to rainy and windy weather, each weather condition presents its own set of challenges, requiring you to adapt your jumping strategy to stay on course.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/2c1ac070bc8c1bb6b714103562b220f7.poster.avif?t=1722237410\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/2c1ac070bc8c1bb6b714103562b220f7.webm?t=1722237410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/2c1ac070bc8c1bb6b714103562b220f7.mp4?t=1722237410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In addition to the engaging gameplay, &quot;Jump on Clouds&quot; offers players the opportunity to customize their experience with a variety of UI designs. Whether you prefer a sleek, minimalist light-blue interface or a colorful aesthetic, you can tailor the game's look to suit your style and mood.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/1fc3ea1f2f459917c2a21a53e999f271.avif?t=1722237410\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/cee69ca6454b8cc33dc4778c3fc0de0c.poster.avif?t=1722237410\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/cee69ca6454b8cc33dc4778c3fc0de0c.webm?t=1722237410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/cee69ca6454b8cc33dc4778c3fc0de0c.mp4?t=1722237410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Jump on Clouds&quot; is a whimsical adventure that invites players to leap through a vibrant sky filled with fluffy clouds and unexpected surprises. In this delightful game, you'll navigate through 30 levels of cloud-hopping fun. There is also infitity mode.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/8cbd9288ab7bf51d62138fcbd88cdf64.avif?t=1722237410\" width=500 height=125 /></span><br>As you bound from cloud to cloud, you'll encounter a variety of entertaining events that add spice to your journey. Keep an eye out for mischievous cats, adorable anime girls, and even the occasional appearance of everyone's favorite green ogre, Shr\u0435g! These unexpected encounters not only keep you on your toes but also add a dash of humor and excitement to your cloud-hopping escapades.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/b5c59a253ad78c8553e3de4d098e39ea.avif?t=1722237410\" width=500 height=125 /></span><br>But it's not just the quirky events that make &quot;Jump on Clouds&quot; a delight to play. The game also features dynamic weather systems in infinity mode that affect your gameplay. From sunny skies to rainy and windy weather, each weather condition presents its own set of challenges, requiring you to adapt your jumping strategy to stay on course.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/2c1ac070bc8c1bb6b714103562b220f7.poster.avif?t=1722237410\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/2c1ac070bc8c1bb6b714103562b220f7.webm?t=1722237410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907080/extras/2c1ac070bc8c1bb6b714103562b220f7.mp4?t=1722237410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In addition to the engaging gameplay, &quot;Jump on Clouds&quot; offers players the opportunity to customize their experience with a variety of UI designs. Whether you prefer a sleek, minimalist light-blue interface or a colorful aesthetic, you can tailor the game's look to suit your style and mood.",
    "short_description": "\u201cJump on the Clouds\u201d is a relaxing platformer in an endless world. There's only one reason to play: to relax and de-stress.",
